Body:
Here is a PR that would fix this issue, tested on my local instance: https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/36790

I chose option (b) - slightly refactor existing functionality. I also chose to make everything as backwards compatible as possible - so model discovery is an opt-in using provider configuration, isntead of automatic. This would hopefully prevent unintended behavior for existing users.

To enable model discovery on any openai compatible provider, even a custom provider, you do this:
```json title="opencode.json" {6-7}
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "provider": {
    "myprovider": {
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
      "enable_model_discovery": true,
      "options": {
        "baseURL": "http://localhost:1234/v1"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
